# Square-based pyramid: 4 vertices form the square base,
# while the 5th is the apex centered aboce the base.
# Coordinates:
# 1 - front-left
# 2 - front right
# 3 - back right
# 4 - back-left
# 5 - apex

v -1.0 0.0 -1.0
v 1.0 0.0 -1.0
v 1.0 0.0 1.0
v -1.0 0.0 1.0
v 0.0 1.5 0.0

# Faces:
# 4 triangular side faces connect the base vertices to the apex
# 1 quadrilateral face forms the square base.

f 1 2 5
f 2 3 5
f 3 4 5
f 4 1 5
f 1 4 3 2